    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "角色詳情",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "旅行者（冰）"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/13/142453215/b4853a53cb90048f71c51c8dcd36558d_5978911882980049525.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年8月7日</color>\n旅行者好呀~8月12日7.0版本更新後，終於要迎來與冰元素共鳴的時刻啦！\n至冬的旅途即將啟程，在這片雪原之上，全新的力量、武器與夥伴正等待著旅行者。一起看看吧~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "過場動畫與預告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "至冬先行短片-風雪翳蔽的凍土"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/11/142453215/d0823da2fe9b5700112ea6603251c725_6714659872465048703.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年5月8日</color>\n在這廣袤的凍原之上，一切暗中湧動的動盪與危機終將遮掩於風雪。\n不過變革終究會產生，在萬物真的歸於永恆的沉寂之前。\n<color=#ff9999>Youtube：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=L5VYUDO6mS8"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "7.0版本預告：「無神憐愛的雪國」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/07/142453215/7431c643869f0f0f0de13a2956e6e171_2802971208053653245.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年7月31日</color>\n死亡尋訪每一個無人看管的寒夜，留下魂靈哀然而泣。\n為了這世間所有的眷戀而哭泣，也為了與那美夢的別離而哭泣。\n<color=#ff9999>Youtube：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=DBZp4sWG_iA"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "至冬探索短片——雪國的冒險"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/12/142453215/22b4037dc09bb647c8b83b59c7f8aef6_266242065145871447.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年7月31日</color>\n在雪國的冰原上探索，你需要一些出行的裝備，再加一點巧妙的靈感，便能開啟一段有趣的冒險。\n<color=#ff9999>Youtube：</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=fJoL9_M0fNw"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "下一站：無神憐愛的雪國——至冬"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/08/13/142453215/972207b3249d252bf31c77a1c8f8fefe_3400618029535044865.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2026年8月1日</color>\n列車緩緩駛向北方…窗外掠過的，是新的風景，腦海中浮現的，卻是一路經歷的故事。那些散落於六國旅途中的故事與線索，最終都指向著下一站—— <color=#99ffff>至冬</color> 。"
      }
    ],
